        <activityName xml:lang="en">Battery, LiIo, rechargeable, prismatic,LiFePO4</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Battery, LiIo, rechargeable, prismatic,LiFePO4
na;
UUID: 634437ec-acf2-32c2-a502-d516048d02b2
All components of the LiFePO4-LiIo-battery: single cell, battery management system, coolingsystem, packing, as well as the electricity, transport and facility required for the assembly of the battery.; Geography: Use in CH
Location:  Use in CH
Technology: Electricity production for own consumption  with battery-connected photovoltaic power plants mounted on buildings slanted roof. 922 kWh/kWp annual electricity output, 1117 kWh/m2 irradiation, 0.75 performance ratio, 13.2% module efficiency.
Time period: Calculation of yield based on production with a state of the art plant.
Production volume: In 2008 there were 3'875 PV-plants with an annual production of 33'400 MWh
Sampling: Statistical data for CH 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_634437ec-acf2-32c2-a502-d516048d02b2.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
